  unitName: Crescendo Megurine Luka
  unitId: 60585
  unitNumber: 8093
  description: A songstress who appeared from another world. Luka's special ability
    to sing in tongues yet unknown to the people of Grand Gaia caused a great stir
    amongst the masses that caused her fame to skyrocket. During this time she also
    acquired a special musical instrument used to compliment her voice on stage.
    It would be this combination which would ultimately cement her position as one
    of the most adored artists of her time. As her soothing voice echoed throughout
    the walls of the ancient ruins, a dark and mysterious glow is said to have lit
    the stage, as if emanating from her.
  summonDesc: My music was meant to bring happiness<br>to this world. I hope you
    enjoy<br>this next song, Summoner.
  fusionDesc: When you cheer me on,<br>the rhythm of my heart grows faster.<br>I
    wonder what that means...
  evoDesc: Your music has awakened<br>a powerful force within me.<br>My voice will
    be able to reach everyone now!
  element: 6
  rarity: 5
